resources.string:
Troubleshoot the following issues and try again:
 1. Please make sure the mobile network signal is good;
 2. Please make sure that the upper part of the phone is placed in the sensing area of the card reader in the pairing process;
 If you still have any questions, please contact a local BYD dealer or the customer service

Troubleshoot the following issues and try again:
 1. Please make sure the mobile network signal is good;
 2. Please make sure that the upper part of the phone is placed in the sensing area of the card reader in the pairing process;
 If you still have any questions, please contact a local %s dealer or the customer service

Three immobilizer modes:
a. Enable immobilizer: Unlock the vehicle before manually pressing the charger lock button to remove the charger;
b. Disable immobilizer: Directly press the charger lock button to pull out the charger;
c. Intelligent immobilizer: In case of full charge, directly press the charger lock button to pull out the charger; otherwise, unlock the vehicle before manually pressing the charger lock button to pull out the charger
